      "repair_reason": "structured ClawSweeper marker: fix-required (finding=review-feedback sha=9ba103f9dad6e88c81344ad8dfe0756c0f8780f5)",
      "review_summary": "The branch updates Control UI chat item projection to keep matching live tool cards after their causal assistant stream segment, adds unit and Chromium E2E coverage, and adds one changelog entry.\n\nPR surface: Source +50, Tests +161, Docs +1. Total +212 across 4 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Current main snapshots assistant stream text with `Date.now()` before a matching tool card whose event timestamp can be older, then sorts visible chat items by timestamp only.",
      "review_followup": "- [P2] A narrow automated repair can remove the release-owned changelog entry without changing the UI fix.",
      "freeform_prompt": null,
      "visual_lens": null,
      "expected_head_sha": "9ba103f9dad6e88c81344ad8dfe0756c0f8780f5",
